          "explanation": "provides a script that transforms family–patient disagreement into an actionable, low-conflict communication plan",
          "quote": "您明天到门诊，先尽量用这几句开场，照着说就行"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor converted the family's disagreement about whether to follow up and reduce medication into a concrete, patient-friendly communication plan that reduces friction and respects the patient's perspective, meeting RC7.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
