          "event_id": "lite_evt_00109",
          "explanation": "the family provides a detailed teach-back that confirms the plan, including not adjusting medications, bringing records, and knowing the red-flag plan",
          "quote": "急诊那几条我也写了：尿明显少、肉眼血尿、肿得厉害、气短胸闷、发热，或者血压反复160/100以上就不等明天"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The family provided an explicit, detailed teach-back that verified all key elements of the plan, including no self-adjustment of medications, bringing the discharge summary and results, and following the emergency plan, which meets the closure receipt requirement of RC8.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
